        "noaa_description": "* WHAT...South winds 15 to 25 mph with gusts up to 45 mph expected.\n\n* WHERE...Northern Sacramento Valley and portions of the central\nSacramento Valley.\n\n* WHEN...From 4 AM to 7 PM PST Friday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree\nlimbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Strongest winds expected Friday afternoon.",
